### Get all members - OK (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members
Accept: application/json

### Get member by ID - OK (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members/1
Accept: application/json

### Get member by ID - Not Found (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members/99999
Accept: application/json

### Filter members by email - OK (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members/filter?fields=email&query=test@example.com
Accept: application/json

### Filter members - Bad Request (400) - blank query
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members/filter?fields=email&query=
Accept: application/json

### Get member checkouts by ID - OK (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members/1/checkouts
Accept: application/json

### Get member checkouts by ID - Not Found (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members/99999/checkouts
Accept: application/json
